1
00:00:13,168 --> 00:00:16,080
Hey, Anna. How’s your holiday going

2
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:20,720
It’s wonderful! I’m at a beach in Sanya!

3
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,352
Wow, lucky you! That sounds amazing.

4
00:00:25,392 --> 00:00:26,704
What’s the weather like there?

5
00:00:27,424 --> 00:00:32,176
It’s hot and sunny. It’s about 28°C.

6
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:36,160
That’s nice! What are you doing at the beach?

7
00:00:36,912 --> 00:00:39,008
I’m sunbathing at the moment!

8
00:00:39,488 --> 00:00:41,552
My brother John’s here too.

9
00:00:42,096 --> 00:00:43,552
Oh, what’s he doing?

10
00:00:44,048 --> 00:00:46,560
He’s playing beach volleyball right now.

11
00:00:47,056 --> 00:00:50,800
What about you? How’s the weather in Stockholm?

12
00:00:51,264 --> 00:00:56,160
Well, it’s cold and snowy. It’s about -3°C.

13
00:00:56,592 --> 00:01:01,232
Oh, that’s really cold! What’s your family doing?

14
00:01:01,616 --> 00:01:04,688
Well, we usually stay in when it snows,

15
00:01:04,848 --> 00:01:08,144
but now we’re building a snowman outside.

16
00:01:08,608 --> 00:01:11,088
Hey, come and visit us some day!

17
00:01:11,392 --> 00:01:14,816
OK. Once the weather turns warm!

